          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="60" y="30" width="2280" height="75" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sla-value-subtitle" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.4&quot;&gt;左侧：收益计算流程；右侧：连续 KV 前缀、恢复时间条与并行工作流示例。&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK SC;fontSize=26;fontColor=#657B90;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;strokeWidth=2;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="60" y="115" width="2280" height="70" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sla-value-inputs" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.4&quot;&gt;① 读取 Agent 的当前完整 KV 与本轮输入&lt;br&gt;每条 Agent 路径只有一个连续备份前缀&lt;br&gt;恢复代价包含读取、重算和必要同步&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK SC;fontSize=27;fontColor=#23384B;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#EDF4FD;strokeColor=#2E6FA8;rounded=1;arcSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="120" y="230" width="1140" height="165" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sla-value-time" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.4&quot;&gt;② 计算保留前 k 块时的最短恢复时间&lt;br&gt;\(T(k)=\min_{0\le j\le k}(T_{\rm load}(j)+T_{\rm recompute}(j)+T_{\rm sync}(j))\)&lt;br&gt;读取前 j 块，重算其余已生成 KV；可回退到更短的前缀&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK SC;fontSize=25;fontColor=#23384B;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#EDF4FD;strokeColor=#2E6FA8;rounded=1;arcSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="90" y="485" width="1200" height="185" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sla-value-slack" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.4&quot;&gt;③ 单个受影响 Agent：扣除 Slack 可吸收的延迟&lt;br&gt;\(J(k)=[T(k)-s]_+,\qquad U(k)=J(0)-J(k)\)&lt;br&gt;\(U(k)=[T(0)-s]_+-[T(k)-s]_+\)&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK SC;fontSize=27;fontColor=#23384B;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#EDF4FD;strokeColor=#2E6FA8;rounded=1;arcSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="90" y="765" width="1200" height="185" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sla-value-prefix" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.4&quot;&gt;④ 按合法前缀变化计算收益或损失&lt;br&gt;\(\text{扩展收益}=U(k+m)-U(k)\)&lt;br&gt;\(\text{截短损失}=U(k)-U(k-m)\)&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK SC;fontSize=28;fontColor=#23384B;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#EDF4FD;strokeColor=#2E6FA8;rounded=1;arcSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="120" y="1045" width="1140" height="180" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sla-value-dag" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.4&quot;&gt;⑤ 多个 Agent 受影响：在工作流 DAG 中合并&lt;br&gt;\(\operatorname{finish}(v)=\max_{u\to v}\operatorname{finish}(u)+d_v+T_v(S)\)&lt;br&gt;最大结束时间记为 D；同一工作流内不直接相加 Agent 收益&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK SC;fontSize=26;fontColor=#23384B;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#EDF4FD;strokeColor=#2E6FA8;rounded=1;arcSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="90" y="1330" width="1200" height="195" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sla-value-objective" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.4&quot;&gt;⑥ 与无备份基线比较，再跨工作流和场景求和&lt;br&gt;\(F(S)=\sum_f\omega_f\sum_w[D_w(\varnothing,f)-D_w(S,f)]\)&lt;br&gt;固定一个故障场景时，权重为 1&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK SC;fontSize=27;fontColor=#23384B;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#EDF4FD;strokeColor=#2E6FA8;rounded=1;arcSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="90" y="1630" width="1200" height="185" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sla-value-operation" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.4&quot;&gt;⑦ 评价当前 S 到候选 S′ 的完整操作&lt;br&gt;\(\Delta F=F(S^\prime)-F(S)\)&lt;br&gt;\(\Delta b=b(S^\prime)-b(S)\)&lt;br&gt;共享物理容量只计一次；后继依赖必须一起处理&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK SC;fontSize=28;fontColor=#23384B;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#EDF4FD;strokeColor=#2E6FA8;rounded=1;arcSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="120" y="1920" width="1140" height="210" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sla-value-return" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.4&quot;&gt;返回操作收益 ΔF 与容量变化 Δb&lt;br&gt;第 2 页执行准入 / 回收；第 4 页计算容量租金与 Credit&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK SC;fontSize=28;fontColor=#118575;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#EDF8F4;strokeColor=#118575;rounded=1;arcSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="120" y="2250" width="1140" height="145" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sla-value-edge-0" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#2E6FA8;strokeWidth=2.4;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=9;jettySize=20;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=9;" edge="1" parent="1" source="sla-value-inputs" target="sla-value-time">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sla-value-edge-1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#2E6FA8;strokeWidth=2.4;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=9;jettySize=20;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=9;" edge="1" parent="1" source="sla-value-time" target="sla-value-slack">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sla-value-edge-2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#2E6FA8;strokeWidth=2.4;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=9;jettySize=20;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=9;" edge="1" parent="1" source="sla-value-slack" target="sla-value-prefix">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sla-value-edge-3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#2E6FA8;strokeWidth=2.4;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=9;jettySize=20;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=9;" edge="1" parent="1" source="sla-value-prefix" target="sla-value-dag">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sla-value-edge-4" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#2E6FA8;strokeWidth=2.4;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=9;jettySize=20;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=9;" edge="1" parent="1" source="sla-value-dag" target="sla-value-objective">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sla-value-edge-5" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#2E6FA8;strokeWidth=2.4;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=9;jettySize=20;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=9;" edge="1" parent="1" source="sla-value-objective" target="sla-value-operation">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sla-value-edge-6" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#2E6FA8;strokeWidth=2.4;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=9;jettySize=20;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=9;" edge="1" parent="1" source="sla-value-operation" target="sla-value-return">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sla-value-slack-threshold" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.4&quot;&gt;Slack 仍然影响收益&lt;br&gt;\(T(0)=12,\ T(1)=8\ \mathrm{ms}\)&lt;br&gt;Slack 为 2 / 10 / 15 ms 时，收益分别是 4 / 2 / 0 ms。&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK SC;fontSize=27;fontColor=#B17A1D;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#FFF7E8;strokeColor=#B17A1D;rounded=1;arcSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="120" y="2470" width="1140" height="160" />
        </mxCell>
